<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ENGLAND 406 ALL OUT IN 1ST INNINGS V ZIMBABWE (376).</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 406 ALL OUT IN 1ST INNINGS V ZIMBABWE (376).</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO, Zimbabwe 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>England, replying to</p>
<p>Zimbabwe's first innings total of 376, were all out for 406 on</p>
<p>the fourth day of the first test at Queen's Club on Saturday.</p>
</text>
